SUMMARY:Firewise: Fire Resilient Landscapes
DESCRIPTION:Come out to the beautiful Capay Valley to learn about fire resilient landscapes and home hardening. California native plants will be available for purchase. The Yolo County Monarch Waystation project will also have plants available. \nLunch is available for purchase.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/firewise-fire-resilient-landscapes/
LOCATION:Western Yolo Grange\, 16787 Forest Ave\, Guinda\, 95637\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Toyon-Capay-Valley-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Webster":MAILTO:kmwspa@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
