SUMMARY:Bohème Bewitched
DESCRIPTION:An enchanted interactive experience from Bohème in Davis\, the thrift boutique two blocks away. Quests through a glowing grove\, a blacklight zombie forest\, a frog bog\, a mermaid lagoon\, a witch’s cottage and a wood full of wisps. Spooky\, not scary. \nSix enchanted lands inside the old bank at 300 E Street\, downtown Davis: the old Union Bank building at the corner of 3rd and E\, next to Panera Bread\, one block from Central Park. \nHours: Wednesday to Friday 3:00 to 6:30pm. Saturday and Sunday 11:00am to 6:30pm. Closed Mondays and Tuesdays. Open 11am to 6:30pm on Saturday\, October 31. \n$4 at the door for the experience\, credited to any $8 purchase in the shop (same visit only). Open to all ages every day until 6:30pm. \nEnchanted Evenings: special evening events run 7 to 9:30pm on Oct 23\, 24 and 30. $13 online\, $15 at the door. \nEvery date\, hours and tickets: bohemebewitched.com
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/boheme-bewitched/2026-10-24/
LOCATION:Bohème Bewitched\, 300 E Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/bewitched-popup.jpg
END:VEVENT
