SUMMARY:Tom and the Broken Hearts
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 25 · 2:00 PM · Railroad Courtyard at Hotel Winters \nWe’re taking the music outdoors! Join us for our first concert at the Railroad Courtyard at Hotel Winters\, a new venue for Winters Live and a fresh way to enjoy the music you love. \nThis special Sunday afternoon show takes place in Hotel Winters’ outdoor courtyard\, offering a new setting to gather with friends and experience the unforgettable sound of Tom Petty\, brought to life by Tom and the Broken Hearts. \nTickets are $45\, to purchase click here.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/tom-and-the-broken-hearts/
LOCATION:Hotel Winters\, 12 Abbey Street\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/jefferson-santos-fCEJGBzAkrU-unsplash-2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
